<title>THAILAND: Thailand to auction 11.5 bln baht notes in March.</title>
<headline>Thailand to auction 11.5 bln baht notes in March.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand said on Monday it scheduled weekly auctions of a total of 11.50 billion baht ($442 million) of short-term notes in March.</p>
<p>Auction schedule: Date	    Tenor (Day)	  Amount</p>
<p>(million baht)    7/3/97	    29		   2,000</p>
<p>			7/3/97	    91		   1,000</p>
<p>			7/3/97	   182		   1,000</p>
<p>		     14/3/97	    30		   2,000</p>
<p>		     14/3/97	  2 years		  500</p>
<p>		     21/3/97	    28		   2,000</p>
<p>		     21/3/97	    91		   1,000</p>
<p>		     28/3/97	    28		   2,000</p>
<p>(US$1  =  26 baht)</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 252-9950</p>
</text>
